WEBVTT

01:26.710 --> 01:29.710
[Glory]

01:30.650 --> 01:33.000
[Episode 18]

01:38.000 --> 01:38.729
Lady Yunyin.

01:42.870 --> 01:43.670
Young Master.

01:45.120 --> 01:45.759
Come here!

02:02.200 --> 02:03.510
Since Lady Shanbao fell sick,

02:03.510 --> 02:04.480
people from the Hualin Courtyard

02:04.480 --> 02:05.680
have rarely come out.

02:06.150 --> 02:07.770
I've been keeping a close eye
on Miss Xiu Qiong,

02:07.770 --> 02:09.970
but I haven't discovered any movement.

02:13.910 --> 02:15.310
Stay away from Xiu Qiong.

02:16.150 --> 02:17.770
Since ancient times,
those who manage households

02:17.770 --> 02:19.250
have always been suspicious.

02:19.250 --> 02:20.980
Lady Shanbao is especially so.

02:22.079 --> 02:24.640
To find Madam Yang,
we must lie low patiently

02:25.310 --> 02:26.710
to succeed at one stroke.

02:27.360 --> 02:28.620
If we miss this chance,

02:29.230 --> 02:30.760
there won't be another one.

02:31.590 --> 02:33.620
Don't think
you're the only capable one in the world

02:33.620 --> 02:34.360
and others are just

02:34.360 --> 02:36.160
useless clay or wooden figures.

02:36.329 --> 02:37.329
Even without you,

02:37.680 --> 02:39.810
the Rong family still won't collapse.

02:51.320 --> 02:53.050
Rong Yunyin, stop right there!

02:54.590 --> 02:56.310
The autumn tea harvest is approaching.

02:56.310 --> 02:58.030
All you care about
is repairing the embankments

02:58.030 --> 02:59.079
and using our Rong family's money

02:59.079 --> 03:00.520
to fill the government's financial holes.

03:00.520 --> 03:02.030
You've been doing it year after year.

03:02.030 --> 03:04.000
Mountains of gold and seas of silver
wouldn't be enough for you to fill them.

03:04.000 --> 03:05.590
There are priorities in everything.

03:05.590 --> 03:07.120
Tea harvesting is important,

03:07.120 --> 03:08.870
but if there are a few more rainstorms,

03:08.870 --> 03:12.270
the tea plantations
at the foot of the mountains will also...

03:13.100 --> 03:13.680
Go away!

03:14.840 --> 03:16.480
People in Linji all say
the Plum Rain Season will be over soon.

03:16.480 --> 03:17.940
This rain won't last long.

03:18.010 --> 03:19.800
The government's workers
for fixing the embankments have all left.

03:19.800 --> 03:21.560
Only you're still living in dreams.

03:21.560 --> 03:23.160
I know what you're thinking.

03:23.480 --> 03:25.150
You just want to show off your authority

03:25.150 --> 03:26.680
and make everyone obey you!

03:27.030 --> 03:28.150
I'd like to see

03:28.770 --> 03:30.680
whether these several small raindrops

03:30.680 --> 03:32.140
can actually kill anyone.

03:35.590 --> 03:36.320
Lady Yunyin.

03:38.300 --> 03:39.760
Please take another look.

03:55.840 --> 03:56.360
My Lady.

04:02.120 --> 04:02.640
Hail!

04:04.040 --> 04:04.750
It's hail!

04:32.210 --> 04:34.060
[Rong Mansion]

04:34.430 --> 04:36.230
Young Master, please slow down.

04:44.430 --> 04:46.120
What's wrong?
Why are they in such a hurry?

04:46.120 --> 04:46.870
Young Master.

04:46.870 --> 04:48.330
I've heard the heavy rain
has destroyed the embankments

04:48.330 --> 04:49.670
and flooded the tea fields
at the foot of the mountains.

04:49.670 --> 04:51.480
Those several mountain paths
have all collapsed.

04:51.480 --> 04:52.950
The Rong family's members
are all rushing to the mountains.

04:52.950 --> 04:54.750
Mr. Yan has gone to help them, too.

04:54.750 --> 04:56.480
Shall I prepare a horse for you?

04:57.000 --> 04:57.860
So you won't go?

04:59.750 --> 05:01.460
Rainstorms and landslides are no jokes.

05:01.460 --> 05:03.270
I've come to the Rong family
to seek fortune,

05:03.270 --> 05:04.800
not to risk my life for them.

05:05.070 --> 05:06.600
Why do I have to work so hard?

05:07.190 --> 05:09.450
Let's wait till the rain stops tomorrow.

05:17.960 --> 05:19.960
-Shanbao! Shanbao!
-Young Master!

05:20.360 --> 05:21.420
Don't go, Shanbao!

05:21.670 --> 05:22.530
You mustn't go!

05:22.800 --> 05:23.930
Don't be so foolish.

05:24.240 --> 05:26.030
The mountain paths
are all blocked by huge rocks now.

05:26.030 --> 05:26.920
You're still having a high fever.

05:26.920 --> 05:28.650
How can you go up the mountains?

05:28.830 --> 05:30.140
The rain is heavy outside.

05:30.140 --> 05:31.600
Escort my cousin back now.

05:32.930 --> 05:34.750
Shanbao, those damaged tea leaves

05:34.750 --> 05:35.830
aren't worthy of you risking your life!

05:35.830 --> 05:37.190
-Young Master!
-Shanbao!

05:37.190 --> 05:37.480
Let's go!

05:37.480 --> 05:38.680
-Shanbao!
-Let's go!

05:39.630 --> 05:41.230
-Let go of me!
-Young Master!

05:42.150 --> 05:42.710
Don't go!

05:45.830 --> 05:46.390
Go back.

05:46.600 --> 05:47.260
Let go of me!

05:47.310 --> 05:48.409
With such a serious natural disaster,

05:48.409 --> 05:49.820
it's beyond human power
to save the stricken area.

05:49.820 --> 05:50.950
It may be a calamity for others,

05:50.950 --> 05:52.120
but not necessarily for you.

05:52.120 --> 05:52.850
If you go now,

05:53.080 --> 05:54.430
all your efforts will be wasted.

05:54.430 --> 05:55.230
Yes, Shanbao!

05:55.280 --> 05:56.080
You absolutely cannot go!

05:56.080 --> 05:57.390
You can't risk your life to protect them!

05:57.390 --> 05:58.190
Young Master!

06:00.360 --> 06:02.290
I must go up the mountains tonight.

06:02.540 --> 06:03.800
Go back and wait for me.

06:07.500 --> 06:08.100
Shanbao!

06:09.160 --> 06:09.960
Young Master!

06:10.140 --> 06:11.260
Shanbao, don't go!

06:13.600 --> 06:14.920
Shanbao! Shanbao!

06:15.190 --> 06:15.800
Young Master!

06:15.800 --> 06:16.750
Young Master, you can't go!

06:16.750 --> 06:17.870
Why are you guys holding me back?

06:17.870 --> 06:18.700
Let's go, Young Master.

06:18.700 --> 06:19.190
Go away!

06:26.240 --> 06:27.000
Young Master!

06:27.000 --> 06:28.530
Did you hear me? Let go of me!

06:28.790 --> 06:29.590
Young Master!

06:40.670 --> 06:41.470
Young Master!

06:41.600 --> 06:43.570
Lady Shanbao's orders cannot be disobeyed!

06:43.570 --> 06:44.700
Let go of me, you all!

06:45.280 --> 06:46.380
-Shanbao!
-Let's go back, Young Master!

06:46.380 --> 06:46.990
Shanbao!

06:47.010 --> 06:48.270
Close the door! Hurry!

07:15.000 --> 07:16.380
The rain is getting heavier and heavier.

07:16.380 --> 07:18.040
Check whether all doors and windows
are closed.

07:18.040 --> 07:18.720
-Yes!
-Yes!

07:30.560 --> 07:31.600
Lady Yunxi and Lady Xiangling

07:31.600 --> 07:32.510
have brought people respectively

07:32.510 --> 07:33.070
to clear away

07:33.070 --> 07:34.920
the huge rocks
blocking the mountain paths overnight.

07:34.920 --> 07:36.360
When the paths are cleared tomorrow,

07:36.360 --> 07:38.360
we'll use a sedan chair
to carry you up the mountains.

07:38.360 --> 07:39.980
This small path
is steep and difficult to walk.

07:39.980 --> 07:41.600
You can't even stand steadily.

07:41.600 --> 07:43.530
You really can't continue to walk.

07:43.630 --> 07:44.290
Or at least,

07:44.670 --> 07:46.930
just let these two men carry you up there.

07:49.600 --> 07:51.310
The mountain path ahead is even steeper.

07:51.310 --> 07:52.440
It's too dangerous.

07:52.800 --> 07:53.560
I can walk.

07:54.430 --> 07:55.310
My Lady.

08:00.800 --> 08:05.730
♪ Who tears a strand
of light from the dark night? ♪

08:05.790 --> 08:06.190
You...

08:06.640 --> 08:07.590
Aren't you going up the mountains?

08:07.590 --> 08:12.580
♪ It jolts my already silent heart
awake ♪

08:07.720 --> 08:08.380
Come up now!

08:14.310 --> 08:19.080
♪ The moon hangs bright,
as breezes dance among stars ♪

08:19.310 --> 08:20.160
You shouldn't have come.

08:19.710 --> 08:25.530
♪ Hear the sighs
for the beauty's fleeting years ♪

08:21.310 --> 08:22.370
On this stormy day,

08:22.920 --> 08:24.830
even snakes and insects know
that they should hide in the caves.

08:24.830 --> 08:26.410
But someone
has insisted on going up the mountains.

08:26.410 --> 08:32.450
♪ Lost in the mortal world,
it fades into twilight ♪

08:26.750 --> 08:29.480
I have no choice but to sacrifice
my safety to accompany you.

08:29.480 --> 08:31.610
At worst, from now on, wherever you go,

08:31.760 --> 08:32.690
I'll go with you.

08:32.960 --> 08:39.000
♪ Grass sprouts, orioles sing,
longevity slips away ♪

08:34.120 --> 08:35.580
If you can't walk anymore,

08:35.700 --> 08:38.030
I'll carry you on my back
and move forward.

08:38.970 --> 08:40.419
Hold tight. If you fall,

08:39.669 --> 08:45.590
♪ Love comes in scattered pairs,
yet thoughts linger on ♪

08:40.919 --> 08:42.390
you'll be smashed into pieces.

08:42.390 --> 08:42.820
Okay.

08:45.610 --> 08:52.080
♪ Drifting with the passing years ♪

08:52.510 --> 08:55.870
♪ Flowers bloom and wither,
the sun climbs and falls ♪

08:55.900 --> 08:59.070
♪ True feelings are like drifting mist ♪

08:59.370 --> 09:01.620
♪ People only know loneliness ♪

09:01.650 --> 09:05.720
♪ Who cares about karma's twist? ♪

09:05.900 --> 09:09.470
♪ Tides ebb and flow,
the moon swells and shrinks ♪

09:09.490 --> 09:12.510
♪ I see through, yet hold my tongue ♪

09:12.580 --> 09:18.850
♪ Too fragile to be put into words ♪

09:29.500 --> 09:32.850
♪ Flowers bloom and wither,
the sun climbs and falls ♪

09:32.880 --> 09:36.050
♪ True feelings are like drifting mist ♪

09:36.350 --> 09:38.600
♪ People only know loneliness ♪

09:37.390 --> 09:38.190
You're awake.

09:38.630 --> 09:42.700
♪ Who cares about karma's twist? ♪

09:42.880 --> 09:46.450
♪ Tides ebb and flow,
the moon swells and shrinks ♪

09:45.200 --> 09:46.480
You kept shivering just now.

09:46.480 --> 09:49.500
♪ I see through, yet hold my tongue ♪

09:47.200 --> 09:48.400
The rain has stopped.

09:48.630 --> 09:49.030
I've told them

09:49.030 --> 09:50.080
to dry our clothes over the fire
before we leave.

09:49.560 --> 09:55.840
♪ Too fragile to be put into words ♪

09:52.270 --> 09:54.790
Don't worry.
Your important business won't be delayed.

09:54.790 --> 09:55.920
It's time to set off.

09:56.150 --> 10:03.430
♪ Too fragile to be put into words ♪

10:08.510 --> 10:10.910
[Rong's Tea Plantation]

10:10.640 --> 10:11.770
-Come on!
-Hurry up!

10:12.790 --> 10:13.480
Come on!

10:13.780 --> 10:15.110
Everyone, act quickly!

10:15.840 --> 10:16.510
Hurry up!

10:17.150 --> 10:18.480
Don't forget this side.

10:18.630 --> 10:20.000
-Okay!
-Cover them quickly!

10:20.000 --> 10:20.720
Hurry up!

10:20.990 --> 10:22.320
Act quickly, you all!

10:22.700 --> 10:23.630
Unfold them all!

10:23.850 --> 10:24.330
Okay!

10:25.870 --> 10:26.320
Hurry!

10:26.380 --> 10:28.460
Bring some stones here to block this area!

10:28.460 --> 10:28.860
Okay!

10:35.630 --> 10:36.830
Spread it over there.

10:37.040 --> 10:38.100
-Okay!
-Spread it over here, too.

10:38.100 --> 10:38.500
Okay!

10:44.030 --> 10:45.110
You blind fool!

10:45.630 --> 10:46.960
Song! Song!

10:49.840 --> 10:50.360
Song!

10:51.870 --> 10:52.810
What are you doing?

10:52.810 --> 10:54.010
How could you hit him?

10:54.030 --> 10:55.110
He hasn't slept

10:55.130 --> 10:55.910
for three consecutive days.

10:55.910 --> 10:57.240
Do you have no humanity?

11:03.220 --> 11:05.270
It's his own fault for being useless.

11:05.270 --> 11:05.840
Why are you all

11:05.840 --> 11:06.670
staring at me?

11:07.030 --> 11:08.790
Hurry up and dig ditches to drain water!

11:08.790 --> 11:10.510
If the roots of the tea trees
rot or wither,

11:10.510 --> 11:11.830
all of you will be held accountable!

11:11.830 --> 11:13.090
None of you can escape!

11:13.400 --> 11:14.260
Get to work now!

11:23.550 --> 11:25.280
Stand up! Take them to work now!

11:31.600 --> 11:32.390
I'm quitting!

11:32.390 --> 11:34.190
You hit people indiscriminately.
Let's quit!

11:34.190 --> 11:38.290
I'm quitting! I'm quitting! I'm quitting!

11:38.320 --> 11:40.300
You're all tea slaves of the Rong family.

11:40.300 --> 11:42.010
Each of you
has signed the servitude indenture.

11:42.010 --> 11:44.630
So what if I hit you?
What can you do about it?

11:45.730 --> 11:49.310
I'm quitting! I'm quitting! I'm quitting!

12:10.720 --> 12:11.290
Stop it!

12:12.050 --> 12:13.710
I'm telling you all to stop it!

12:18.310 --> 12:18.850
Stop it!

12:28.730 --> 12:29.660
Stop it, you all!

12:32.790 --> 12:33.710
It's Lady Shanbao!

12:33.710 --> 12:35.040
Lady Shanbao is back!

12:39.320 --> 12:40.080
Rong Yunyin.

12:41.100 --> 12:43.300
Is this how you manage the plantations?

12:47.630 --> 12:48.240
Buddies!

12:48.610 --> 12:50.630
The Rong family
doesn't treat us as humans!

12:50.630 --> 12:52.270
Lady Yunyin
is her own younger sister.

12:52.270 --> 12:53.510
How could she possibly
speak for outsiders?

12:53.510 --> 12:55.570
-That's right!
-Yeah! That's right!

12:57.450 --> 12:59.380
-They're a family!
-That's right!

13:01.200 --> 13:03.910
The tea plantations at the foot
of the mountains are all flooded.

13:03.910 --> 13:05.640
Many tea trees on the mountains

13:05.640 --> 13:07.370
have also been damaged by hail.

13:07.510 --> 13:08.770
This year's autumn tea

13:08.930 --> 13:11.660
depends entirely
on these several plantations.

13:11.670 --> 13:12.800
Guys, please help to

13:13.200 --> 13:14.970
dig ditches to drain water overnight

13:14.970 --> 13:17.300
so that the tea trees
won't soak in water for too long.

13:17.300 --> 13:18.030
We must find a way

13:18.030 --> 13:19.250
to preserve next year's harvest.

13:19.250 --> 13:20.870
Your Rong family
always abuses and exploits the workers.

13:20.870 --> 13:22.290
How could you still expect us
to work hard for you?

13:22.290 --> 13:23.600
That's right! I'm quitting!

13:23.600 --> 13:24.630
Let's go down the mountains tonight!

13:24.630 --> 13:26.000
-Let's go!
-Let's go! I'm quitting!

13:26.000 --> 13:26.930
-Let's go!
-That's right! Let's go!

13:26.930 --> 13:28.990
What rights do you have to hit others?

13:29.950 --> 13:30.460
Stop!

13:30.790 --> 13:31.390
Exactly!

13:34.480 --> 13:35.790
The monthly wages in Rong's Plantation

13:35.790 --> 13:37.720
are already 10% higher than the others'.

13:37.720 --> 13:39.320
During every tea-picking season,

13:39.320 --> 13:39.960
Lady Shanbao would even give you

13:39.960 --> 13:41.750
extra five dou of rice each month.

13:41.750 --> 13:43.170
Those who have elderly people at home

13:43.170 --> 13:45.150
would receive
additional firewood, wine and meat.

13:45.150 --> 13:46.480
Lady Yunyin may be overbearing,

13:46.480 --> 13:47.270
but Lady Shanbao has never

13:47.270 --> 13:48.550
treated any of you unfairly.

13:48.550 --> 13:49.080
Besides, you all

13:49.080 --> 13:50.500
have signed the servitude indenture.

13:50.500 --> 13:52.510
Once you defy the tea plantation's owner,

13:52.510 --> 13:54.720
sending you to officials for punishment
would be a minor consequence.

13:54.720 --> 13:55.390
In the future, if Lady Shanbao

13:55.390 --> 13:56.920
makes a statement about it,

13:56.940 --> 13:59.200
which tea plantation
will dare to hire you?

13:59.200 --> 14:00.700
For a momentary fit of anger,

14:00.700 --> 14:02.480
you might make your family members
live a hard life.

14:02.480 --> 14:03.480
It's not worth it.

14:04.240 --> 14:05.700
That's truly not worth it.

14:06.560 --> 14:07.630
Capture that ringleader

14:07.630 --> 14:08.320
for me now!

14:09.190 --> 14:10.990
I'd like to see who dares to do it!

14:17.580 --> 14:18.510
W-Well...

14:23.820 --> 14:24.670
Shanbao.

14:36.790 --> 14:38.320
All of you, look carefully!

14:38.510 --> 14:39.720
The mark on this whip

14:40.440 --> 14:41.960
is in the shape of tea leaves

14:41.960 --> 14:43.670
and has been passed down for 400 years.

14:43.670 --> 14:45.750
The Rong family
has planted vast tea groves here

14:45.750 --> 14:47.270
and established tea trade routes.

14:47.270 --> 14:48.420
In the city, hundreds of

14:48.420 --> 14:49.550
large or small shops

14:49.550 --> 14:51.280
all make a living by tea leaves.

14:51.440 --> 14:53.000
You are all mountain people,

14:53.000 --> 14:55.030
who have lived here for generations.

14:55.030 --> 14:56.620
You depend on the mountains for a living

14:56.620 --> 14:58.030
by growing and processing tea leaves.

14:58.030 --> 15:00.360
Without tea, you cannot survive.

15:01.150 --> 15:01.960
Without tea,

15:02.630 --> 15:04.030
up and down the mountains,

15:04.030 --> 15:05.690
how many people would starve?

15:06.360 --> 15:08.550
Tea is the lifeblood of tea artisans.

15:09.440 --> 15:11.790
This tea plantation is my lifeblood.

15:15.200 --> 15:16.840
Those who are willing to stay tonight

15:16.840 --> 15:18.720
will receive extra two months' wages.

15:18.720 --> 15:20.670
As for those who dare to
leave the mountains without permission,

15:20.670 --> 15:23.150
if the autumn tea leaves
can't be delivered

15:23.750 --> 15:25.940
and the reputation
of the Rong family's tea is damaged,

15:25.940 --> 15:26.500
they would be considered as destroying

15:26.500 --> 15:28.360
the livelihood of countless tea farmers

15:28.360 --> 15:29.510
and making enemies

15:29.510 --> 15:30.440
with me forever.

15:31.080 --> 15:32.680
Just see if I would spare him.

15:33.870 --> 15:35.390
What Lady Shanbao said makes sense.

15:35.390 --> 15:35.960
Yes.

15:36.320 --> 15:37.120
Lady Shanbao truly

15:37.120 --> 15:38.750
shows solicitude
for rough fellows like us.

15:38.750 --> 15:40.030
With Lady Shanbao here,

15:40.030 --> 15:41.320
we don't need to worry.

15:41.720 --> 15:42.200
Yi.

15:43.900 --> 15:44.700
Give her a hoe.

15:45.490 --> 15:48.090
Tell her to go down there
and clear the silt too.

15:49.000 --> 15:49.720
Take a hoe!

15:53.030 --> 15:53.830
I'm not going!

15:55.160 --> 15:56.490
I'm not going, Shanbao!

15:56.790 --> 15:57.920
I'm your own sister.

15:57.960 --> 15:59.670
How could you treat me like this?

15:59.670 --> 16:00.800
I'm sorry, Shanbao!

16:01.120 --> 16:02.720
I'm not going! I'm not going!

16:03.630 --> 16:04.360
Shanbao!

16:10.030 --> 16:11.890
This boy just fainted from shock.

16:11.910 --> 16:13.560
His life is not in danger for now.

16:13.560 --> 16:15.760
Take him down to bandage his wounds now.

16:20.050 --> 16:20.850
Lady Shanbao.

16:22.990 --> 16:23.870
Get to work now.

16:26.110 --> 16:27.390
Let's get to work!

16:27.840 --> 16:28.360
Come on!

16:28.360 --> 16:29.440
Let's get to work!

16:30.320 --> 16:31.180
Just disperse.

16:46.270 --> 16:49.330
Having whipped her this time
will deepened her hatred.

16:49.600 --> 16:51.600
If you want her to truly submit to you

16:51.720 --> 16:53.380
and try to make peace with her,

16:53.510 --> 16:56.170
I don't think
you can achieve that in the future.

16:56.270 --> 16:58.200
Her feelings for me are worthless.

16:59.750 --> 17:02.080
But my tea leaves are extremely valuable.

17:02.150 --> 17:04.550
I can't afford to wait.
Nor do I dare to wait.

17:07.000 --> 17:08.730
Your kindness has been wasted.

17:09.400 --> 17:12.079
However, as for what I've promised you,

17:12.829 --> 17:14.560
I will definitely keep my word.

17:24.069 --> 17:26.589
Rong Shanbao, you'd better

17:28.000 --> 17:28.720
truly remember

17:28.720 --> 17:29.780
this promise well.

17:34.550 --> 17:36.430
The weather has cleared up.
Guys, act quickly!

17:36.430 --> 17:37.770
-Okay!
-Okay!

17:42.450 --> 17:44.560
[Rong's Tea Plantation]

18:03.510 --> 18:05.110
Lady Yunxi, Lady Xiangling.

18:05.440 --> 18:06.160
Mr. Yan.

18:07.110 --> 18:08.350
Wasn't there some trouble

18:08.350 --> 18:09.920
in the tea plantations on the mountains?

18:09.920 --> 18:10.850
Where is Yunyin?

18:12.110 --> 18:13.310
Yunxi!

18:13.630 --> 18:14.220
Yunxi!

18:18.040 --> 18:19.860
Yunxi, save me now!

18:20.200 --> 18:21.220
Save me now!

18:24.240 --> 18:25.510
Yunxi!

18:25.740 --> 18:27.800
I... I can't stand it anymore!

18:27.830 --> 18:29.090
Take me back home now!

18:30.440 --> 18:31.160
Yunyin.

18:31.310 --> 18:32.980
You were sent here
to manage the tea plantations.

18:32.980 --> 18:34.750
How did you end up
looking like a mud monkey?

18:34.750 --> 18:35.680
What happened?

18:36.570 --> 18:38.300
It's all Rong Shanbao's fault.

18:38.330 --> 18:39.970
I fell into a mud pit.

18:43.880 --> 18:45.550
Shut up! All of you, shut up!

18:46.030 --> 18:47.030
Who dares to laugh?

18:47.030 --> 18:47.550
Shut up!

18:48.070 --> 18:48.750
Shut up!

18:49.000 --> 18:51.030
Believe it or not,
I'll slaughter all of you!

18:51.030 --> 18:51.760
Lady Yunyin.

18:52.240 --> 18:54.550
I'm afraid
what you're saying doesn't count.

18:54.550 --> 18:55.510
That's right.

18:56.070 --> 18:58.400
Yeah! That's right! Exactly!

18:59.320 --> 19:01.360
Where is Lady Shanbao?
How come she's not here?

19:01.360 --> 19:03.160
Lady Shanbao
was worried about the new plantation,

19:03.160 --> 19:05.290
so she asked Mr. Lu to go there with her.

19:11.960 --> 19:13.200
Is there any medicine for wounds here?

19:13.200 --> 19:14.600
Mr. Yan is badly injured.

19:16.560 --> 19:17.240
He must have got injured

19:17.240 --> 19:18.830
from clearing the obstacles
on the roads previously.

19:18.830 --> 19:20.000
I told you not to do it personally,

19:20.000 --> 19:20.870
but you refused to listen to me.

19:20.870 --> 19:22.960
How are we supposed to explain this
to Grandmother?

19:22.960 --> 19:24.030
Hurry! Take him

19:24.030 --> 19:26.490
to the tea shed over there
to apply medicine.

19:30.680 --> 19:32.310
Young Master, you're too honest.

19:32.310 --> 19:33.750
Look how cunning that guy is.

19:33.750 --> 19:35.400
He always chooses the perfect moments
to curry favor.

19:35.400 --> 19:37.130
It's not Lady Shanbao's fault.

19:39.360 --> 19:42.920
Yunxi, take me back home now!

19:56.690 --> 19:57.440
Yunxi!

19:59.400 --> 20:00.240
Yunxi!

20:02.280 --> 20:04.270
You withdrew all the workers
who were repairing the embankments,

20:04.270 --> 20:04.960
which caused the 800 acres of tea fields

20:04.960 --> 20:06.700
at the foot of the mountains
to be flooded.

20:06.700 --> 20:08.720
Tonight,
you've been left here to dig ditches,

20:08.720 --> 20:10.720
which could barely count as
atonement for your mistakes.

20:10.720 --> 20:12.190
Otherwise,
if Grandmother hears about this,

20:12.190 --> 20:13.850
you'll be in serious trouble.

20:14.070 --> 20:15.860
After you've made such a big mistake,

20:15.860 --> 20:16.350
except for

20:16.350 --> 20:17.830
your own sister born from the same mother,

20:17.830 --> 20:19.590
who else would help you clean up the mess?

20:19.590 --> 20:20.590
This is not just punishment for you,

20:20.590 --> 20:22.450
but she's also trying to save you.

20:22.960 --> 20:23.690
Rong Yunyin,

20:24.110 --> 20:25.930
you've been muddle-headed
for so many years.

20:25.930 --> 20:28.590
Who is close or estranged?
And who is good or bad?

20:29.420 --> 20:31.220
It's also time for you to wake up.

21:33.080 --> 21:35.280
My Lady, he's the one from the He family.

21:36.850 --> 21:37.910
Tell him to go back.

21:42.440 --> 21:44.400
Haven't we already asked someone
to deliver the message?

21:44.400 --> 21:45.510
When Lady Yunxi has time,

21:45.510 --> 21:46.750
she will surely meet with you.

21:46.750 --> 21:48.880
Master He, please wait patiently
for a few more days.

21:48.880 --> 21:49.940
Please go back now.

21:50.110 --> 21:51.110
No more nonsense.

21:52.030 --> 21:53.960
The tea mountains are all flooded.

21:54.310 --> 21:56.280
You're still trying to fool people, huh?

21:56.280 --> 21:57.540
Bring her down to talk.

22:00.160 --> 22:00.760
Come down!

22:01.730 --> 22:02.550
Lady Yunxi!

22:06.750 --> 22:08.200
Previously, I heard that your He family

22:08.200 --> 22:09.420
was a powerful non-native,

22:09.420 --> 22:10.550
specializing in gaining improper benefits

22:10.550 --> 22:11.790
on the waterways.

22:12.210 --> 22:13.810
I thought it was just a rumor,

22:14.310 --> 22:16.240
but now I'm seeing it with my own eyes.

22:16.240 --> 22:18.090
Who do you think my Rong family is?

22:18.090 --> 22:19.920
How dare you, a non-native,
act so impudently?

22:19.920 --> 22:21.510
I can't worry about all that now.

22:21.510 --> 22:23.310
After this year's autumn-tea-leaf picking
is finished,

22:23.310 --> 22:25.070
if the Rong family
can't deliver the tea leaves,

22:25.070 --> 22:26.200
half of my assets

22:26.590 --> 22:27.790
will be lost in there.

22:28.310 --> 22:30.840
Unlike you,
I wasn't born with a silver spoon.

22:31.000 --> 22:31.720
I've earned every copper coin

22:31.720 --> 22:33.720
by fighting through wind and waves.

22:34.070 --> 22:35.440
Lady Yunxi, I'm sorry but you have to

22:35.440 --> 22:36.240
come with me.

22:36.480 --> 22:38.350
When Old Madam Rong
gives me a definite answer,

22:38.350 --> 22:41.240
I promise I'll send you back home
safe and sound.

22:43.440 --> 22:44.000
Stop it!

22:55.040 --> 22:56.920
Lady Shanbao has said
these several days might not be peaceful

22:56.920 --> 22:57.550
and has specifically ordered me

22:57.550 --> 22:59.280
to escort Lady Yunxi back home.

22:59.510 --> 23:00.270
Alright.

23:00.720 --> 23:02.790
I've also lived my life
on the edge of a knife

23:02.790 --> 23:04.450
and have never feared anyone.

23:04.480 --> 23:06.480
Truth has never depended on
how loudly one speaks.

23:06.480 --> 23:09.140
Your Rong family
owes me 1,000 jin of tea leaves.

23:09.440 --> 23:10.710
It's all clearly written

23:10.710 --> 23:12.070
on the paper.

23:12.640 --> 23:14.750
We may have to settle this
at the County Office,

23:14.750 --> 23:16.440
which will cause you great trouble.

23:16.440 --> 23:17.960
Go ahead and file charges if you want.

23:17.960 --> 23:19.720
There are still a few more questions

23:19.720 --> 23:22.250
Lady Shanbao
would like to ask you, Master He.

23:22.830 --> 23:23.480
He Gui!

23:25.010 --> 23:25.720
Have you settled

23:25.720 --> 23:26.750
the murder case

23:26.750 --> 23:28.120
you committed in Pingjiang?

23:28.120 --> 23:29.000
Your 5,000-tael stolen money

23:29.000 --> 23:30.350
can't be used to buy our legal tea leaves.

23:30.350 --> 23:32.310
I suggest you to keep the money
to buy your life instead.

23:32.310 --> 23:33.600
In Linji's territory,

23:33.800 --> 23:36.050
even a powerful non-native
would become a struggling scoundrel.

23:36.050 --> 23:38.070
Lady Shanbao
wasn't going to deal with you,

23:38.070 --> 23:40.360
but you're
asking for trouble here yourself.

23:40.360 --> 23:41.890
Your deposit
has been sent back to your place.

23:41.890 --> 23:42.510
Your eight sworn brothers

23:42.510 --> 23:43.400
who traveled with you

23:43.400 --> 23:44.270
are now tied up

23:44.270 --> 23:46.390
under the big willow tree
at the Shili Slope outside the city.

23:46.390 --> 23:48.310
In the future, if you dare to be violent
and aggressive again,

23:48.310 --> 23:49.110
killing innocent people

23:49.110 --> 23:51.590
and breaking
the Rong family's cardinal rules,

23:51.590 --> 23:52.440
even with the 100 thievish guards

23:52.440 --> 23:53.750
you've brought,

23:54.230 --> 23:56.760
just see
whether you can leave the city or not.

24:07.970 --> 24:09.000
Was it really Rong Shanbao

24:09.000 --> 24:10.460
who asked you to pick me up?

24:11.400 --> 24:12.970
Lady Yunxi, please.

24:18.060 --> 24:19.630
[Rong Mansion]

24:24.210 --> 24:26.010
Thankfully, my dear Bao is here.

24:26.150 --> 24:27.930
If we had relied on those several girls,

24:27.930 --> 24:30.330
who can't tell right from wrong,

24:30.800 --> 24:32.160
I'm afraid they would have

24:32.160 --> 24:33.240
made terrible mistakes

24:33.240 --> 24:34.590
and would ruin
our Rong family's century-old business

24:34.590 --> 24:35.520
sooner or later.

24:36.310 --> 24:37.750
I was right about you.

24:38.100 --> 24:40.500
You are truly
the pillar of our Rong family.

24:40.580 --> 24:42.640
We can't be without you even for a day.

24:57.200 --> 24:59.030
Grandmother, I'm back.

24:59.530 --> 25:01.460
You boasted about it in front of me,

25:01.750 --> 25:04.550
but you didn't even show up
after causing trouble.

25:04.590 --> 25:07.000
Is this
how you sisters take responsibility?

25:07.000 --> 25:07.660
Kneel down!

25:13.400 --> 25:14.830
Grandmother, please let me explain.

25:14.830 --> 25:16.690
It was Yunyin who swore to Heavens

25:16.960 --> 25:19.030
and asked me to entirely entrust
the tea plantations to her.

25:19.030 --> 25:20.510
She said even if the sky fell,

25:20.510 --> 25:22.170
she would be able to handle it.

25:22.680 --> 25:24.480
It's my fault for being gullible

25:24.510 --> 25:26.330
and believing in her boastful words.

25:26.330 --> 25:28.670
And I was too focused
on the autumn tea business,

25:28.670 --> 25:31.200
so I didn't monitor the work
in the plantations on a daily basis.

25:31.200 --> 25:33.110
Laster, I became so soft-hearted that

25:33.110 --> 25:34.510
I was deceived by others,

25:34.640 --> 25:36.680
signing a contract with the He family.

25:36.680 --> 25:38.480
I didn't know he was such a brute,

25:38.780 --> 25:39.510
who somehow

25:39.510 --> 25:40.830
heard some gossip

25:41.310 --> 25:43.510
and believed that the Rong family
couldn't deliver the tea leaves.

25:43.510 --> 25:45.110
It almost led to big trouble.

25:45.300 --> 25:47.440
Because of that,
Lady Shanbao had to work while being sick,

25:47.440 --> 25:49.240
and you got so worried and angry.

25:51.030 --> 25:52.550
Please forgive me, Grandmother.

25:52.550 --> 25:53.480
I'm sorry.

25:55.750 --> 25:56.400
Yun'e.

25:56.680 --> 25:58.030
Intercede for me now.

26:04.000 --> 26:05.930
Three days ago, right in this hall,

26:06.460 --> 26:08.790
Yunxi and Yunyin firmly made a guarantee,

26:08.830 --> 26:10.310
only saying
for a hundred years in Linji,

26:10.310 --> 26:12.070
there had never been heavy rain
destroying the tea leaves.

26:12.070 --> 26:12.960
You even withdrew the people

26:12.960 --> 26:15.480
Lady Shanbao had sent
to repair the embankments.

26:15.480 --> 26:17.640
It showed that you only cared about
immediate benefits

26:17.640 --> 26:19.040
with no long-term plans.

26:20.310 --> 26:22.440
Unfortunately, Heaven wasn't on your side.

26:22.440 --> 26:24.480
The tea plantations at the foot
of the mountains are all destroyed.

26:24.480 --> 26:25.590
The tea trees on the mountains

26:25.590 --> 26:27.250
were all damaged by hail, too.

26:27.440 --> 26:29.270
Now that this disaster has happened,

26:29.270 --> 26:30.930
with all this mess left there,

26:31.070 --> 26:32.200
what should we do?

26:32.830 --> 26:33.750
Your knees

26:33.750 --> 26:35.350
aren't made of gold and jade.

26:35.620 --> 26:36.680
The tea trees that were washed away

26:36.680 --> 26:37.930
won't come back
no matter how long you kneel.

26:37.930 --> 26:38.560
Besides,

26:38.890 --> 26:40.890
you've always been close to Yunyin.

26:40.960 --> 26:42.400
You two are on the same side.

26:42.400 --> 26:43.590
How would you bear to let her

26:43.590 --> 26:45.480
suffer alone in the tea plantations?

26:45.480 --> 26:45.920
Perhaps you'd better

26:45.920 --> 26:47.780
share some of the burden with her.

26:57.110 --> 26:58.750
Please don't be angry, Grandmother.

26:58.750 --> 27:00.480
When a newbie tries to pan-fry tea leaves,

27:00.480 --> 27:02.310
he might scorch them,
make them too yellow,

27:02.310 --> 27:03.070
overdo it

27:03.440 --> 27:05.170
or fail to dry them thoroughly.

27:05.350 --> 27:08.110
No newbies could do it perfectly
without any mistakes.

27:08.110 --> 27:09.070
At this point,

27:10.240 --> 27:11.700
blaming Yunxi won't help.

27:12.730 --> 27:14.790
Let's just find a way to make up for it.

27:18.400 --> 27:20.270
But please don't worry, Grandmother.

27:20.270 --> 27:21.500
I've already asked people

27:21.500 --> 27:23.000
to urgently transfer tea leaves
from the prefectures and counties

27:23.000 --> 27:25.060
that are unaffected by the disaster.

27:25.640 --> 27:27.640
However,
the Longjing tea leaves produced elsewhere

27:27.640 --> 27:29.570
are not as good as those from Linji.

27:29.750 --> 27:31.070
Yunxi, I'd like to ask you

27:31.070 --> 27:32.950
to visit our old customers one by one

27:32.950 --> 27:33.760
and discuss

27:34.160 --> 27:36.410
how to make up
for this year's autumn tea leaves first.

27:36.410 --> 27:39.740
We absolutely cannot
damage the Rong family's reputation.

27:39.890 --> 27:41.050
Of course.

27:47.400 --> 27:48.330
Watch your step.

27:49.560 --> 27:50.160
Come here.

28:01.750 --> 28:03.080
There's another matter

28:03.110 --> 28:04.910
I need to tell you, Grandmother.

28:05.650 --> 28:06.850
This child's mother

28:07.240 --> 28:09.240
was a tea worker in our plantations.

28:09.350 --> 28:12.100
She often delivered meals
and did trivial work at the embankments.

28:12.100 --> 28:15.070
A few days ago, she was unfortunately
washed away by the flood.

28:15.070 --> 28:16.680
Seeing that this child has nowhere to go

28:16.680 --> 28:18.510
and she's so adorable and beautiful,

28:18.510 --> 28:19.970
I want to keep her by my side

28:20.240 --> 28:21.770
and adopt her as my daughter

28:21.930 --> 28:23.480
to prevent her from being homeless

28:23.480 --> 28:25.010
and all alone in this world.

28:28.800 --> 28:29.960
She's just a child.

28:31.000 --> 28:31.860
If you like her,

28:32.200 --> 28:33.660
just keep her by your side.

28:35.380 --> 28:37.040
It's her good fortune as well.

28:43.110 --> 28:44.110
Did you hear that?

28:44.550 --> 28:45.680
From today onwards,

28:45.880 --> 28:47.940
you are a daughter of the Rong family.

28:58.590 --> 28:59.240
Look.

29:00.400 --> 29:01.350
It wants to eat something.

29:01.350 --> 29:02.200
Put it here.

29:04.200 --> 29:05.550
It's all spilled out.

29:21.960 --> 29:22.790
Rong Shanbao.

29:23.720 --> 29:25.790
You were aware of Mr. He's background.

29:25.790 --> 29:27.790
You also knew
Yunyin's temperament very well.

29:27.790 --> 29:29.030
Obviously, you set up a trap

29:29.030 --> 29:30.640
and tried to make us fall into it.

29:30.640 --> 29:32.040
Do you think I can't sense

29:32.300 --> 29:33.960
these schemes of yours at all?

29:34.230 --> 29:35.960
Sooner or later, I'll expose everything
in front of Grandmother.

29:35.960 --> 29:37.960
Then none of us can get any benefits.

29:38.300 --> 29:39.540
Now I understand,

29:40.090 --> 29:41.020
three years ago,

29:41.860 --> 29:44.180
when you went all the way
to Fuzhou to learn tea skills,

29:44.180 --> 29:46.110
you truly benefited a lot from it.‌

29:50.380 --> 29:51.620
A moment of passion

29:51.960 --> 29:53.440
resulted in this romantic entanglement.

29:53.440 --> 29:55.240
Even if Grandmother finds out about it,

29:55.240 --> 29:55.920
I'll just be labeled as

29:55.920 --> 29:57.320
a rebellious young girl.

29:57.920 --> 29:59.580
It won't shake my foundation.

30:00.110 --> 30:01.880
Grandmother will still have to
keep me around

30:01.880 --> 30:03.160
to compete with you.

30:04.050 --> 30:05.130
This is what an heir

30:05.150 --> 30:06.080
must go through.

30:06.750 --> 30:08.110
Just like a whetstone,

30:08.680 --> 30:10.680
I'm still of great use to Grandmother.

30:10.680 --> 30:12.410
How would she easily give me up?

30:12.890 --> 30:13.980
Don't think that

30:14.500 --> 30:15.870
you can threaten me

30:16.620 --> 30:17.660
with this child.

30:21.400 --> 30:22.330
Call her Mother.

30:23.160 --> 30:23.570
You...

30:27.550 --> 30:29.790
In the past, children from our Rong family

30:29.790 --> 30:31.360
were treated by all sisters
as their own kids

30:31.360 --> 30:32.820
and were raised together.

30:33.230 --> 30:35.490
If you teach her
to call us Mother or Aunt,

30:35.510 --> 30:37.060
it would just create alienation instead.

30:37.060 --> 30:38.520
Since she calls me Mother,

30:39.070 --> 30:40.530
calling you Mother as well

30:40.970 --> 30:42.420
is simply following the old custom

30:42.420 --> 30:44.750
of the Rong family sisters
raising children together.

30:44.750 --> 30:47.190
What right do outsiders have to comment?

30:50.480 --> 30:51.200
Mother.

30:56.440 --> 30:57.310
Regardless of what kind of person

30:57.310 --> 30:58.770
her birth father might be,

30:59.070 --> 31:01.920
and whether Grandmother
would allow him to join our family,

31:01.920 --> 31:03.850
I only acknowledge this one thing.

31:04.110 --> 31:05.400
The offsprings of the Rong family

31:05.400 --> 31:07.330
cannot be left abandoned outside.

31:08.240 --> 31:10.400
Let's raise and teach
our daughter properly.

31:10.400 --> 31:11.880
Don't let her become as wilful

31:11.880 --> 31:14.240
and undisciplined as Yunyin
when she grows up.

31:14.240 --> 31:16.640
By that time,
it'll be too late to regret it.

32:30.000 --> 32:30.920
Pack up the young master's things

32:30.920 --> 32:31.520
properly.

32:31.800 --> 32:34.000
Then take them to the Xinfang Pavilion.

32:37.750 --> 32:39.410
When did I say I was moving out?

32:39.750 --> 32:41.060
Who told you to touch my things
without permission?

32:41.060 --> 32:43.230
Jun Dai! What's going on?

32:45.960 --> 32:46.820
Say something.

32:47.590 --> 32:48.790
I ordered them

32:49.550 --> 32:50.440
to move your belongings

32:50.440 --> 32:52.100
back to the Xinfang Pavilion.

32:53.190 --> 32:54.440
Lady Shanbao,
you haven't recovered from your cold yet.

32:54.440 --> 32:56.750
There should be someone
taking care of you by your side.

32:56.750 --> 32:57.610
I'm not moving.

32:58.750 --> 32:59.280
Go ahead.

33:02.980 --> 33:03.840
Put them down!

33:26.830 --> 33:29.290
I've thought carefully
about what you said.

33:30.720 --> 33:32.070
Though we are sisters

33:32.590 --> 33:33.790
from the same family,

33:34.240 --> 33:35.500
I can't always give in,

33:35.680 --> 33:37.140
which might pose a threat.

33:37.200 --> 33:38.960
Those who should be suppressed
must be suppressed, too.

33:38.960 --> 33:41.060
Those who should be restricted
must also be restricted.

33:41.060 --> 33:42.790
I have to make plans decisively

33:42.960 --> 33:44.960
and implement them appropriately.

33:45.200 --> 33:46.750
I can't damage our sisterhood

33:46.750 --> 33:48.480
or break Grandmother's heart.

33:48.960 --> 33:51.960
I also need to handle everything
nicely and decently.

33:52.000 --> 33:53.800
Therefore, I've made up my mind.

33:54.110 --> 33:55.040
I'll keep Yunyin

33:55.680 --> 33:58.160
in the tea plantations
to atone for her mistakes.

33:58.160 --> 34:00.590
She always complains
that Grandmother favors others

34:00.590 --> 34:02.480
and doesn't allow her
to enter the plantations.

34:02.480 --> 34:03.920
So I'll just ask her to start with

34:03.920 --> 34:06.590
such trivial work as digging ditches
and planting tea trees.

34:06.590 --> 34:08.480
Once she understands others' hardships,

34:08.480 --> 34:10.440
she'll realize what mistakes she has made.

34:10.440 --> 34:11.550
We'll discuss this matter later.

34:11.550 --> 34:13.409
But Lady Shanbao, I'm not moving.

34:14.550 --> 34:16.770
Delivery of this year's autumn tea leaves
will inevitably be delayed.

34:16.770 --> 34:18.920
Some of our old customers
are difficult to deal with.

34:18.920 --> 34:20.920
I'm afraid they won't save face for Yunxi.

34:20.920 --> 34:23.760
I'd better visit them personally
to smooth things over.

34:23.760 --> 34:25.440
Rong Shanbao, today, why are you...

34:25.440 --> 34:27.630
Xiu Qiong,
stay home and make preparations.

34:27.630 --> 34:28.920
You don't need to come with me.

34:28.920 --> 34:29.440
Yes.

34:30.230 --> 34:31.030
Rong Shanbao.

34:31.090 --> 34:31.920
I haven't finished speaking yet,

34:31.920 --> 34:33.520
and you're already leaving.

34:35.360 --> 34:37.020
You used me and then dumped me.

34:37.480 --> 34:40.010
How could there be such a person
in this world?

34:41.980 --> 34:43.620
Congratulations, Mr. Lu!

34:44.040 --> 34:45.770
Mr. Lu, there will be a wedding.

34:52.150 --> 34:52.880
A wedding?

34:55.400 --> 34:56.840
Once we finish the ceremony
in front of the paired pillars

34:56.840 --> 34:57.880
in the Rong family's ancestral hall,

34:57.880 --> 35:00.010
we'll be husband and wife officially.

35:00.550 --> 35:01.590
In the hundred years
of the Rong family's history,

35:01.590 --> 35:03.150
there has never been another case
like this.

35:03.150 --> 35:04.080
That's not okay.

35:04.970 --> 35:06.510
My Lord, you are a distinguished official
in the imperial court

35:06.510 --> 35:08.150
and a close minister to the Emperor

35:08.150 --> 35:09.670
with limitless prospects.

35:09.670 --> 35:11.670
You're only gaining experience
in the provinces for a few years.

35:11.670 --> 35:13.440
You'll return to the capital
sooner or later.

35:13.440 --> 35:14.800
If you're truly going to get married,

35:14.800 --> 35:16.030
you can choose a prime minister's daughter

35:16.030 --> 35:17.630
or even a prince's daughter.

35:17.800 --> 35:19.150
How could you stay in Linji

35:19.150 --> 35:21.070
and become a son-in-law
to that Rong family?

35:21.070 --> 35:23.320
As an official, I strive to
bring benefits for the local people.

35:23.320 --> 35:24.030
It doesn't matter

35:24.030 --> 35:25.560
where I work as an official.

35:26.190 --> 35:27.760
Even though there are many powerful people

35:27.760 --> 35:28.700
and beautiful ladies in the capital,

35:28.700 --> 35:29.670
how could I possibly find

35:29.670 --> 35:31.920
another Lady Rong Shanbao from there
to be my match?

35:31.920 --> 35:33.250
Fortunately, I've been

35:33.630 --> 35:35.960
steadfast in my principles
and cautious from the start.

35:35.960 --> 35:37.630
I never curry favor with the powerful men

35:37.630 --> 35:39.360
or make marriage promises easily.

35:39.360 --> 35:42.190
I've been determined to wait for someone
I truly love.

35:42.190 --> 35:44.300
Otherwise, if I were to change my mind
and get engaged to Lady Rong Shanbao now,

35:44.300 --> 35:45.180
wouldn't I become

35:45.180 --> 35:46.780
a person who breaks his word?

35:49.430 --> 35:50.830
What did you just say?

35:51.440 --> 35:52.970
I think you're just jealous

35:53.230 --> 35:54.830
and trying to stand in my way.

35:54.960 --> 35:55.630
My Lord!

35:56.670 --> 35:57.840
Alright, alright.

35:58.540 --> 36:00.190
I know no matter how hard you've tried,

36:00.190 --> 36:01.400
you still can't get into the Rong family.

36:01.400 --> 36:02.190
Being able to see Bao once

36:02.190 --> 36:03.960
should be considered as your good fortune.

36:03.960 --> 36:05.880
If one constantly
harbors jealousy and anxiety,

36:05.880 --> 36:08.080
it's easy for illness
to develop in his organs.

36:08.080 --> 36:09.550
That would be unfortunate.

36:09.550 --> 36:10.840
What are you implying?

36:12.030 --> 36:13.280
My Lord, you're going to marry a beauty

36:13.280 --> 36:14.440
and are quite satisfied,

36:14.440 --> 36:16.230
but you mustn't
forget the important matters.

36:16.230 --> 36:17.670
The Wei family's old case
remains unsolved,

36:17.670 --> 36:19.150
and Madam Yang is still missing.

36:19.150 --> 36:19.840
Nor do we know what tricks

36:19.840 --> 36:22.240
the Rong family has played
in this process.

36:23.400 --> 36:24.730
As the presiding judge,

36:25.000 --> 36:27.130
you will eventually face her in court.

36:27.150 --> 36:28.750
If you two truly get married,

36:28.840 --> 36:31.110
how will the Wei family's grievances
be redressed?

36:31.110 --> 36:32.770
And how will you make a ruling?

36:43.480 --> 36:45.430
I will certainly be fair and impartial,

36:45.430 --> 36:46.760
showing no favoritism.

36:48.630 --> 36:50.400
Even if you maintain absolute fairness

36:50.400 --> 36:51.940
and show no favoritism to relatives,

36:51.940 --> 36:52.980
Lady Rong Shanbao

36:53.030 --> 36:54.160
is extremely proud.

36:54.230 --> 36:55.030
She will surely suspect that

36:55.030 --> 36:57.030
you have ulterior motives
for infiltrating into the Rong family.

36:57.030 --> 36:58.560
Let alone becoming lovers,

36:59.110 --> 36:59.760
I'm afraid

37:00.210 --> 37:02.130
she might confront you with weapons.

37:02.130 --> 37:03.130
She won't do that.

37:03.990 --> 37:05.250
And I certainly won't.

37:05.550 --> 37:06.630
Even if that doesn't happen,

37:06.630 --> 37:08.320
how will you handle the situation?

37:08.320 --> 37:09.710
Therefore,
this wedding with the Rong family

37:09.710 --> 37:11.310
absolutely cannot proceed.

37:11.410 --> 37:11.900
No way.

37:12.280 --> 37:12.950
My Lord!

37:15.950 --> 37:18.150
You haven't even thought this through.

37:18.760 --> 37:20.110
The Rong family is prestigious

37:20.110 --> 37:21.550
with great power throughout Linji.

37:21.550 --> 37:24.510
How would they tolerate me
refusing the marriage arbitrarily?

37:24.510 --> 37:26.240
Although I've infiltrated into
the Rong family now,

37:26.240 --> 37:27.670
I haven't seen Madam Yang yet.

37:27.670 --> 37:29.180
My household has even been attacked,

37:29.180 --> 37:30.830
and my status remains unclear.

37:30.830 --> 37:32.150
Before reinforcements
arrive from the capital,

37:32.150 --> 37:33.950
can I even leave the Rong family?

37:35.260 --> 37:36.520
My Lord, you're right.

37:36.800 --> 37:39.000
I've failed to consider it thoroughly.

37:39.120 --> 37:40.380
What should we do then?

37:41.840 --> 37:42.900
To find Madam Yang,

37:43.320 --> 37:44.520
I already have a plan.

37:44.920 --> 37:46.000
However, there's an important matter

37:46.000 --> 37:47.400
that I need you to handle.

37:48.230 --> 37:50.400
Last night, while interrogating Qing Yun,
I got his confession

37:50.400 --> 37:51.320
that after his success,

37:51.320 --> 37:52.670
anyone who wanted to
curry favor with Xu Song

37:52.670 --> 37:54.110
must first pay him a visit.

37:54.110 --> 37:55.360
He also didn't reject anyone's visit

37:55.360 --> 37:56.810
and has benefited greatly from it.

37:56.810 --> 37:57.630
He even keeps

37:57.630 --> 37:59.670
an opera performer as his mistress
in the Zhenhe Street.

37:59.670 --> 38:00.500
She possesses

38:00.960 --> 38:02.020
a ledger secretly,

38:02.640 --> 38:05.630
which has records about all bribe money
Xu Song has received.

38:05.630 --> 38:07.400
But you can't deal with it in person.

38:07.400 --> 38:08.400
I'm afraid Xu Song

38:08.510 --> 38:09.670
has already become suspicious of you.

38:09.670 --> 38:11.010
Since it's the vital physical evidence,

38:11.010 --> 38:12.180
I should go myself.

38:12.510 --> 38:13.710
My Lord, don't worry.

38:13.920 --> 38:15.320
I will be extra cautious.

38:15.840 --> 38:16.900
It's getting late.

38:16.920 --> 38:17.880
My Lord, you should go back now

38:17.880 --> 38:21.140
lest the Rong family's members
should become suspicious.

38:26.710 --> 38:28.510
Fragrance pouches and sachets!

38:28.840 --> 38:29.970
Come and take a look!

38:30.800 --> 38:32.630
Fragrance pouches and sachets!

38:37.800 --> 38:40.550
Fragrance pouches and sachets!

38:43.240 --> 38:45.200
[Baozhi Pharmacy]

38:44.590 --> 38:45.390
Young Master.

38:45.510 --> 38:46.110
After the heavy rain,

38:46.110 --> 38:48.000
Lady Shanbao has been incredibly busy.

38:48.000 --> 38:48.590
Her daily medicine

38:48.590 --> 38:49.920
is all decocted in the tea plantations.

38:49.920 --> 38:51.670
There are available doctors
accompanying her.

38:51.670 --> 38:52.840
Why did Miss Xiu Qiong

38:52.840 --> 38:53.970
go to the Baohe Hall?

38:56.250 --> 38:57.780
Let's talk when we get back.

39:03.830 --> 39:04.630
Young Master.

39:04.740 --> 39:06.090
These two men are acting suspiciously.

39:06.090 --> 39:08.290
There must be something fishy going on.

39:08.400 --> 39:10.270
Lady Rong Shanbao
is difficult to deal with.

39:10.270 --> 39:11.110
This is a perfect chance
to let those two men

39:11.110 --> 39:12.230
be my vanguards.

39:12.620 --> 39:14.360
It's also good
to have them test the water.

39:14.360 --> 39:15.690
Keep a close eye on them.

39:15.840 --> 39:17.390
If there's any unusual activity,

39:17.390 --> 39:18.790
report it to me immediately.

39:18.790 --> 39:19.270
Yes.

39:40.480 --> 39:41.590
-Young Master!
-My tofu!

39:41.590 --> 39:42.800
What's wrong with you?

39:42.800 --> 39:43.710
You knocked over my tofu.

39:43.710 --> 39:44.640
You can't leave!

39:45.050 --> 39:45.650
Take this.

39:46.550 --> 39:47.480
This is not okay.

39:47.710 --> 39:48.960
Tofu means "gathering luck."

39:48.960 --> 39:50.360
You've knocked over my container,

39:50.360 --> 39:51.030
and my luck has run away.

39:51.030 --> 39:51.800
We've given you the money.

39:51.800 --> 39:52.800
Why are you still trying to pester us?

39:52.800 --> 39:54.150
Such a small sum of money is not enough.

39:54.150 --> 39:54.960
Do you know how hard it is

39:54.960 --> 39:55.800
to make tofu?

39:57.030 --> 39:57.800
You can't leave!

39:57.800 --> 39:58.600
That's right.

40:12.360 --> 40:14.110
Mr. Hu, stop moving around.

40:14.280 --> 40:16.340
Let me carry this stuff there for you.

41:13.590 --> 41:14.650
What's that noise?

41:15.070 --> 41:16.370
It seems to be coming from the tea house.

41:16.370 --> 41:17.770
Let's go check it out now.

41:32.750 --> 41:34.360
Isn't this Yang Yitang?

41:35.070 --> 41:36.200
Did you two see that?

41:36.480 --> 41:37.940
A thief tried to attack me.

41:38.170 --> 41:39.700
You ungrateful scoundrel!

41:39.880 --> 41:41.400
We usually treat you as an honored guest

41:41.400 --> 41:43.320
and provide you
with the best food and drinks.

41:43.320 --> 41:45.030
I can't believe
you turn out to be a thief.

41:45.030 --> 41:45.510
Tell me!

41:45.760 --> 41:46.710
Why did you sneakily

41:46.710 --> 41:47.570
follow us here?

41:47.590 --> 41:48.910
Could it be that you want to steal

41:48.910 --> 41:51.070
the Rong family's tea-making methods?

41:51.070 --> 41:52.280
Lady Shanbao, I'm innocent.

41:52.280 --> 41:52.960
Help!

41:52.990 --> 41:54.440
How dare you still tell lies?

41:54.440 --> 41:55.990
Xiangling, stop it!

42:00.030 --> 42:01.590
I... I followed Mr. Lu

42:01.590 --> 42:02.230
in here.

42:02.840 --> 42:04.480
Everyone in this mansion is saying

42:04.480 --> 42:06.320
Lady Rong Shanbao has allowed him
to pay respects at the ancestral hall

42:06.320 --> 42:07.150
and complete the wedding ceremony.

42:07.150 --> 42:08.320
It's such wonderful news.

42:08.320 --> 42:10.380
I... I was going to congratulate him.

42:10.440 --> 42:11.590
But I saw him change into casual clothes,

42:11.590 --> 42:13.800
avoid people
and sneak around suspiciously,

42:13.800 --> 42:14.920
so I followed him in here.

42:14.920 --> 42:15.550
You're still lying?

42:15.550 --> 42:16.920
Lady Shanbao, if you don't believe it,

42:16.920 --> 42:18.230
ask Mr. Lu to come over here.

42:18.230 --> 42:19.440
I'm willing to confront him face to face.

42:19.440 --> 42:20.190
Just ask him to come over here.

42:20.190 --> 42:21.320
Then you'll know the truth.

42:21.320 --> 42:22.400
Heaven is watching above us.

42:22.400 --> 42:24.070
If anything I've said is untrue,

42:24.070 --> 42:26.930
just let that lightning
strike half of my body down.

42:35.280 --> 42:36.550
Do you know this trick

42:38.000 --> 42:40.060
has been used by someone else before?

42:41.280 --> 42:42.280
Why on earth

42:42.800 --> 42:44.150
did you follow him here?

42:45.760 --> 42:46.360
My...

42:46.920 --> 42:49.670
My... My cousin was perfectly fine

42:49.670 --> 42:51.060
when he entered the Rong Mansion.

42:51.060 --> 42:52.960
Then he died
and was carried back home on a board.

42:52.960 --> 42:54.800
After that, the elders sent me here,

42:54.800 --> 42:56.800
hoping that I could accomplish something.

42:56.800 --> 42:59.320
Last time, a woman visited the house
and claimed to be a relative.

42:59.320 --> 42:59.880
I thought

42:59.880 --> 43:01.680
Mr. Lu was keeping someone here.

43:02.030 --> 43:04.150
I expected to get something on him

43:04.150 --> 43:05.550
so that I could threaten him.

43:05.550 --> 43:06.510
But unexpectedly,

43:06.510 --> 43:07.840
I offended Lady Rong Shanbao.

43:07.840 --> 43:09.090
What are you talking about?

43:09.090 --> 43:10.300
You're talking nonsense.

43:10.300 --> 43:11.960
I think you've lost your mind.

43:12.810 --> 43:14.590
Mr. Hu has been working on
pan-frying tea leaves

43:14.590 --> 43:15.980
in our plantations for 30 years.

43:15.980 --> 43:17.340
He unfortunately injured his leg.

43:17.340 --> 43:19.600
I accompanied Shanbao here to visit him.

43:20.150 --> 43:20.710
Amazing!

43:21.230 --> 43:23.440
No matter how many plasters I used,
it wasn't effective.

43:23.440 --> 43:25.230
Thankfully, Lady Shanbao brought me

43:25.230 --> 43:26.860
the prescription from the Baohe Hall.

43:26.860 --> 43:28.190
It's really effective.

43:28.680 --> 43:29.610
Look at this leg.

43:29.960 --> 43:31.990
I can even walk a few steps
without any pain now.

43:31.990 --> 43:32.800
In this way,

43:33.230 --> 43:35.830
it won't hinder me
from pan-frying tea leaves.

43:36.510 --> 43:37.910
I'm glad it's effective.

43:38.550 --> 43:40.190
Lady Shanbao,
we've searched the entire courtyard

43:40.190 --> 43:40.960
and found no outsiders.

43:40.960 --> 43:42.150
The footprints on the low wall

43:42.150 --> 43:43.880
belong to just one person, too.

43:44.110 --> 43:45.800
You shameless liar!

43:45.950 --> 43:47.350
What else can you say now?

43:48.320 --> 43:50.000
I saw him enter the alley
with my own eyes.

43:50.000 --> 43:51.400
He must have been trying to mislead us.

43:51.400 --> 43:52.920
Lady Shanbao, if you hurry back now,

43:52.920 --> 43:55.050
I'm sure you can catch him red-handed.

44:00.690 --> 44:01.120
Go!

44:01.930 --> 44:03.230
[Rong Mansion]

44:13.260 --> 44:14.480
Those dragon-and-phoenix

44:14.480 --> 44:16.510
and marital-harmony patterns
are too vulgar.

44:16.510 --> 44:18.260
It's better
to choose the Magnolia patterns.

44:18.260 --> 44:19.030
Let's also not waste

44:19.030 --> 44:21.050
that pair of phoenixes
you've carefully drawn.

44:21.050 --> 44:22.220
Make them into shoe uppers.

44:22.220 --> 44:23.320
I'm sure Lady Shanbao will be pleased.

44:23.320 --> 44:24.110
I got it.

44:24.130 --> 44:26.530
Thank you for your guidance, Young Master.

44:27.360 --> 44:28.320
If you want to use flowers,

44:28.320 --> 44:29.650
why not choose peonies?

44:29.670 --> 44:30.480
That would symbolize
wealth and prosperity.

44:30.480 --> 44:31.880
It must not be too vulgar.

44:32.110 --> 44:33.400
Okay. I got it.

44:38.100 --> 44:38.630
Alright.

44:44.230 --> 44:46.200
Fortunately,
I didn't go in there recklessly.

44:46.200 --> 44:47.330
It was indeed a trap.

47:20.440 --> 47:22.780
[West Lake Longjing Tea]

47:23.190 --> 47:24.400
I've already asked people

47:24.400 --> 47:25.960
to urgently transfer tea leaves
from the prefectures and counties

47:25.960 --> 47:28.020
that are unaffected by the disaster.

47:28.590 --> 47:30.670
However,
the Longjing tea leaves produced elsewhere

47:30.670 --> 47:32.600
are not as good as those from Linji.

47:32.760 --> 47:34.070
Yunxi, I'd like to ask you

47:34.070 --> 47:35.860
to visit our old customers one by one

47:35.860 --> 47:36.750
and discuss

47:37.140 --> 47:39.360
how to make up
for this year's autumn tea leaves first.

47:39.360 --> 47:41.230
We absolutely cannot
damage the Rong family's reputation.

47:41.230 --> 47:42.350
West Lake Longjing Tea

47:42.350 --> 47:44.440
is one of our country's top 10
famous tea types.

47:44.440 --> 47:45.230
It's nurtured

47:45.230 --> 47:47.280
in a uniquely favorable
natural environment,

47:47.280 --> 47:49.530
embodying the essence
of the West Lake's landscape

47:49.530 --> 47:51.190
and the wisdom
of the West Lake's tea artisans.

47:51.190 --> 47:53.480
West Lake Longjing Tea
originated in the Tang Dynasty,

47:53.480 --> 47:55.400
became famous
in the Song and Ming Dynasties,

47:55.400 --> 47:57.210
flourished in the Qing Dynasty
and is promoted nowadays.

47:57.210 --> 47:59.590
It's renowned
for its green color, rich aroma,

47:59.590 --> 48:01.000
sweet taste and beautiful appearance,

48:01.000 --> 48:02.070
making it famous worldwide.

48:02.070 --> 48:03.120
That's why it's deeply loved

48:03.120 --> 48:04.590
by people
both domestically and internationally.

48:04.590 --> 48:06.550
The ancestors
in the West Lake Longjing Tea Region

48:06.550 --> 48:07.670
and their successors

48:07.670 --> 48:09.580
gradually developed methods for

48:09.760 --> 48:11.710
good varieties selection,
diligent cultivation

48:11.710 --> 48:12.840
and meticulous picking processes

48:12.840 --> 48:14.920
through long-term production practices.

48:14.920 --> 48:16.800
Especially during the pan-frying process,

48:16.800 --> 48:18.400
they gradually developed

48:18.400 --> 48:19.880
a set of distinctive technical

48:19.880 --> 48:20.920
pan-frying methods,

48:20.920 --> 48:22.670
namely, the West Lake Longjing Tea's

48:22.670 --> 48:23.670
10 Major Pan-frying Techniques.

48:23.670 --> 48:24.840
The West Lake Longjing Tea

48:24.840 --> 48:26.360
is integrated
with Hangzhou's landscape

48:26.360 --> 48:28.470
as well as its culture and history.

48:28.590 --> 48:31.030
Its production technique
is a UNESCO intangible cultural heritage

48:31.030 --> 48:32.630
and an important component of

48:32.630 --> 48:33.970
China's traditional tea-making techniques

48:33.970 --> 48:35.200
and related customs.
